Upstream-Name: aperf
Source: https://github.com/aws/aperf
Comment: The aperf binary statically links the aya Rust eBPF loader
 (https://github.com/aya-rs/aya, MIT OR Apache-2.0) and embeds a compiled eBPF
 object that includes the libbpf headers (https://github.com/libbpf/libbpf,
 LGPL-2.1 OR BSD-2-Clause). See the THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES file shipped in
 /usr/share/doc/aperf/ for the third-party attributions and license texts.

